    "scope": "One YAML 1.2 document from local bytes as a typed tree on the two schema-neutral valid controls. PyYAML applies YAML 1.1 implicit resolvers; the controls avoid every scalar whose type differs between YAML 1.1 and the 1.2 core schema. No tags, merge keys, multi-document streams or malformed input were tested.",
    "family": "PyYAML pure-Python loader (yaml/scanner.py, parser.py, composer.py, SafeConstructor, YAML 1.1 Resolver); not the libyaml CSafeLoader route",
    "family_note": "Pure-Python PyYAML: yaml/reader.py decodes the bytes, scanner.py and parser.py build the event stream, composer.py builds nodes, SafeConstructor builds dict/list/scalars and resolver.py applies the YAML 1.1 implicit resolvers. The pinned manylinux wheel also ships the _yaml C extension (libyaml), but yaml.SafeLoader does not use it; yaml.CSafeLoader is the separate libyaml-family route, selected as its own path (projects/yaml/python/pyyaml_csafeloader). ruamel.yaml derives from this code; oyaml and yamlcore wrap it.",
    "shared_families": [
      "PyYAML pure-Python loader lineage (ruamel.yaml derived from it; oyaml and yamlcore wrap it)"
